<p>Hi <strong>{{username}}</strong>,</p>
<p>We received a request to reset your password. Use the code below:</p>
<div style="margin:16px 0;padding:16px;background:#f4f4f5;border-radius:6px;font-family:monospace;font-size:16px;text-align:center;letter-spacing:1px;color:#18181b">{{token}}</div>
{{#if resetUrl}}
<p><a href="{{resetUrl}}" style="display:inline-block;padding:12px 24px;background:#18181b;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:6px;font-weight:500">Reset Password</a></p>
{{/if}}
<p>This code expires in <strong>{{expiryHours}} hour(s)</strong>.</p>
<p>If you didn't request this, you can safely ignore this email.</p>
